            "text": "Plays like <color orange>Speed Chuzzle!<_tc>  Watch out, the lock bar gets faster with each move!",
            "note": "also silently pushes rule id 15 (no display text of its own, empty string in the decompile) onto the active list - purely a mechanical flag"},
        {"id": 3, "icon": "gametype/3ten", "name": "Chuzzle In Ten",
            "color": "cyan",
            "text": "Plays like <color cyan>Chuzzle In Ten!<_tc>  Choose carefully, you only get <blinky>ten moves!<_tc>",
